<section class="section n-why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="section-label">Why us</div>
      <h2>What you get that you would not get elsewhere</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:24px">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i></div><h4>HubSpot depth, not agency breadth</h4><p>We do not run ad accounts or design brand systems. We architect HubSpot. When your problem is a broken data model or a routing rule that silently drops leads, you want the team that has seen it thirty times, not the team adding CRM to its service list.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal delay-1"><div class="card-icon blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i></div><h4>Fast and directly reachable</h4><p>A dedicated implementation team means work moves in days rather than sprint cycles. You talk to the people building your system, and you get an answer inside 24 hours on business days.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal delay-2"><div class="card-icon orange"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i></div><h4>Documented, not black-boxed</h4><p>Every build ships with SOPs, data model documentation, and a permission matrix. If we stopped working together tomorrow, your team could still run the system, change it, and explain it to a new hire.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

